  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms 1 box
Created 4 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (4 4 4)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds

mass 1 26.98

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

